# Project Images

Place your project images in this folder with the following names:
- ai-chat.jpg
- ecommerce-dashboard.jpg
- data-visualizer.jpg
- fitness-app.jpg
- doc-bot.jpg
- portfolio-generator.jpg

Recommended image specifications:
- Format: JPG, PNG, or WebP
- Dimensions: 800x600px or 16:9 aspect ratio
- File size: < 500KB for optimal performance
